# Snapshot_008: Sample Playback, Play Mode list focused (F7) (VISUAL_DIFF §3.7).
stock Snapshot_008.png
project Jude Frankum - Chill Out Room
script
  wait 300
  tap DOWN x13
  tap SAMPLEPLAYBACK
  tap F7
  wait 300
end

